# SQLite database + WAL sidecars — rebuilt from migrations + seed on boot.
# Leading ** so this matches server/typescript/data/, not just a data/ at the
# repo root: a pattern containing a slash is anchored to the .gitignore's own
# directory, which is why the un-prefixed version silently matched nothing.
**/data/*.db
**/data/*.db-wal
**/data/*.db-shm

# Coverage reports — regenerated by `make coverage`
coverage/

# Uploaded listing photos — user content, not source
**/data/uploads/
